        <mxCell id="boundary" value="Scope: six private connectors (B2B Router, Banqup, EDICOM, SERES, ZeroComa, Sovos) + SPFE = seven; one common Sage API contract.&#10;A direct provider consumer is an alternative executor role, not a second sender for an action already assigned to a connector.&#10;Shared API access has role-specific permissions. Notifications are dispatch, not a separate invoice API. Crossed lines do not join." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
